    <!--
      System launch splash background.

      Charcoal in both light and dark mode, because it hands over to the Compose
      launch screen (`ui/launch/LaunchScreen.kt`), which is charcoal by design - the
      reference art is a dark surface in either theme. This used to be white in light
      mode so that the system splash handed over to a white canvas; with a branded
      launch screen behind it, white would flash for one frame and then go dark.

      Equal to BgDark, so the seam between the system splash and the first Compose
      frame is one flat colour. There is deliberately no values-night override.
    -->
    <color name="daymark_splash_background">#121214</color>
</resources>
